@Tatiana Mirson We had chatted a bit about the available triggers. This is the list: https://firefox-source-docs.mozilla.org/toolkit/components/messaging-system/docs/TriggerActionSchemas/index.html

Note that I believe we can also use those triggers to do some logic to determine whether or not to show a message. For example, we could use the idle trigger, and then only show the message IF the user has a profile of X age, doesn't have Sync enabled, etc. That logic can make use of these attributes:

https://firefox-source-docs.mozilla.org/browser/components/newtab/content-src/asrouter/docs/targeting-attributes.html
